, PDF Spaces, Acrobat Pro, AI Assistant, plus Adobe Express Premium.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Price + buttons group -->\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;width:100%;align-items:center;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Adobe Clean',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;line-height:19px;letter-spacing:-0.16px;text-align:center;\">US$24.99/mo annual, billed monthly</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n          <!-- Free Trial primary button -->\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:999px;background:#ffffff;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Adobe Clean',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;color:#000000;min-width:117px;white-space:nowrap;\">Free Trial</button>\n          <!-- Compare Plans outline button -->\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #ffffff;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Adobe Clean',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;color:#ffffff;white-space:nowrap;\">Compare Plans</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Bottom spacer so background image (laptop) shows through -->\n      <div style=\"width:100%;height:680px;flex-shrink:0;\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <style>\n    @media (max-width:1024px) {\n      [data-figma-node-id=\"10559:113746\"] .copy-lockup-inner { font-size:40px !important; line-height:44px !important; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width:768px) {\n      [data-figma-node-id=\"10559:113746\"] { min-height:740px !important; }\n      [data-figma-node-id=\"10559:113746\"] > div { padding:0 24px !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</section>",
